{
 "slug": "cut-dry-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Freed up on each order taken off the phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is the go-live window for most distributors"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "Same Day"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "first order for most kitchens"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "The Usual Trigger"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "What actually sends people looking for an alternative to Cut+Dry"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "Cut+Dry calls itself online ordering and sales tools for foodservice. It serves distributors, manufacturers and restaurants from one platform. That breadth is the product, and replacing it rarely makes sense. What sends a buyer to a Cut+Dry competitor is usually one narrower thing."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "Some accounts would rather talk than tap"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "Ordering at any hour only helps the kitchens that open the storefront. Plenty still call the office or leave a message instead, and someone at your end writes each one up."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "Who checks what their AI transcribed?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "Cut+Dry's AI Order Desk turns calls and voicemail messages into orders, which is genuinely useful. Their own description mentions no step where the kitchen confirms what was transcribed, so the first person to check those lines is on your side."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "Starting over is the expensive fix"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "Cut+Dry publishes \"Go Live in Under 90 Days\", a good result for a platform that size. Going through a launch like that again, and changing how your customers pay, just to fix phone orders makes no sense. No Cut+Dry alternative should ask that of you."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "A Cut+Dry alternative you add rather than swap in"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "Spoken, then fixed on screen"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "Your account holds the button and says what is short. Items come up as lines with quantities from their own guide, they correct anything off, and they send."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "Your customer looks at the list before anything leaves"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "Said in the kitchen at any hour you are closed"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "Saves 20 to 30 minutes compared with the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Interrupted halfway? It holds the order until they come back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Every guide begins as the list you keep now"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "Pass us the guides you keep per customer. We load them with your SKUs and the price you set for that account, so the kitchen orders your products at your prices."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "A kitchen sees nothing but the lines it buys"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "Pricing and the catalog remain yours to set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Change a guide once and every later order uses it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "Each line ties back to your own SKU"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "It turns up the way your desk expects"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "A finished order leaves as an email carrying a PDF, Excel or Word file, or goes straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks, in a shape your desk opens daily."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Addressed to a rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "Over EDI, the API or QuickBooks, nobody on your team retypes it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "You do not have to remove any software first"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Stock beside the orders as they come"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions carries real-time inventory visibility tied to what is being ordered, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It does not replace your stock system: that stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Every line you carry, not only the quick movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Stock numbers come from the system you count with today"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "Nothing gets counted in our app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Room For Both"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "Cut+Dry for the platform, voice for the phone accounts"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "We are not a Cut+Dry replacement and could not be one. The spoken reorder adds on, so you can still try it if Cut+Dry already runs your payments and your storefront."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Let the storefront do its job"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "Discovery, search and a published catalog are real work, and none of it happens here. The accounts who want to browse keep browsing. The ones who just want to repeat Friday's order get a quicker way to do it."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Money and paperwork stay put"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "Our app never touches money. Nothing about adding it asks you to move how customers pay or how invoices go out, which is usually the part nobody wants to disturb."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "Our orders go where you point them"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "Whichever system you picked is where ours show up, by EDI, through the API or in QuickBooks, or by email to your desk. Nothing changes in Cut+Dry."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "See one spoken reorder sit beside Cut+Dry"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. One account, one order spoken from a sample guide, and where it would land among your other orders."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, and no launch date"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "Nothing here needs a project plan, and Cut+Dry carries on as normal. You send guides, we set up accounts, your kitchens start ordering."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Hand us your guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "Whatever format they are already in. Each account's lines and your prices go into a single admin screen, lined up with your codes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "We set up each account"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "We open an account for each kitchen, and the kitchen installs our app. Most have ordered before the day is out."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "The order arrives priced"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "Your customer has approved it. It carries an order number and the time it was sent, in a format your system takes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "Cut+Dry, plus VoiceOrder Solutions."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "Plus a spoken reorder."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "Plus, Not Instead"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "A second tool should only add, so the column with both products has a checkmark on every row. Cut+Dry is a wide platform, with ordering, payments and tools for reps. A Cut+Dry alternative search tends to start with the accounts that use none of it. The two do not connect, and every fact about Cut+Dry comes from their own site."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "Cut+Dry + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "Cut+Dry on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "Kitchens speak their reorder into an app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "89a5813a-10f6-6ba1-6eed-d733971a550a"
     },
     "text": "Spoken calls transcribed into orders"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "A storefront with intelligent search and product discovery"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "Orders hold if the cook is pulled away mid-list"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Integrated digital payments and automated invoicing"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Customer data, notes and pricing for reps in one place"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "Each account has its own guide, at your prices"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "Ordering open around the clock"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Your customer checks the order before it sends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "Manufacturer product data, images and nutritionals"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "What teams keeping Cut+Dry ask us"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Does adding voice orders mean finding a Cut+Dry alternative?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "No. Cut+Dry's call transcription already turns what callers say into orders, and it carries on unchanged. What VoiceOrder Solutions adds beside it is an app where the account talks through its order and approves the lines itself. The ones who browse your storefront keep browsing, and nothing gets switched off first."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions better than Cut+Dry?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "No, not at selling a catalog, collecting payments, or working with the manufacturers in their network. Those are what they built, and we would not ask you to give them up. Where we help is the reorder from an account you already have, spoken off your guide and approved before it sends. That narrow job is often what a Cut+Dry alternative search was really about."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "Does VoiceOrder Solutions link up with Cut+Dry?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "It does not. The two products have no connection, and neither vendor supports the other. Each passes its orders to your own system on its own, ours in the formats listed above. When ours come in by EDI or the API, both end up in the same system; an emailed order arrives as a file to open like any other email."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Will some kitchens be using two ordering apps?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "Only the ones you offer it to. Accounts happy ordering through Cut+Dry can stay there. The app is for kitchens that still pick up the phone, which is where a spoken, checked order frees up your desk the most. Calls you keep taking get no order number from us; only what is sent through our app does."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "What if a cook gets pulled away halfway through an order?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "Their list stays saved where they stopped, so they can pick it up again when they are back, and nothing goes out until they send it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "How quickly can accounts start sending orders?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "For most distributors this is live inside 24 to 48 hours, with a first order usually in on the same day. Nothing about your Cut+Dry setup has to change while it goes in."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "How do the costs work?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "Neither of us publishes a figure. Cut+Dry has a pricing page with no prices on it, and ours comes as a quote. Since that platform is staying, the thing to price is only what the voice reorder adds."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the Cut+Dry details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t99",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a59f340d29ae03c3ad7",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "All of the above was read on their own site, 10 October 2026: the module descriptions, the line about transcribing calls and the published 90 day launch. We have left their growth percentages alone, because those are their numbers. Should any of that be outdated, tell us and we will correct the page."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
